        "block-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We are all in constant search of beauty solutions to boost our confidence. But why rely solely on experts when you know what works best for you? We’re here to challenge the “experts-only” mindset. As a home salon beauty brand, our mission is to empower everyone to take control of their beauty routines. Since 2019, we’ve been creating at-home alternatives for popular salon treatments, services, and products. With us, beauty is simplified, norms are disrupted, and everyone can become their own best beauty expert.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
